  introDialogueLines:
  - Hey there, Detective! Welcome to the City Eco-Watch station.
  - Different neighborhoods around the city have 10 specific pieces of litter hiding
    in plain sight.
  - Take my Field Checklist, explore the 5 districts before the 4:00 timer runs out,
    and press E to collect each item and learn its story!
  activeProgressDialogue: You're doing great! Check your Field Checklist (TAB) or
    press F for a Compass Hint if you get stuck.
  turnInDialogue: Incredible detective work! You tracked down every single item on
    the Field Checklist! Let's tally your Star Rating and Bonus Quiz!
  completedDialogue: Thanks for keeping our city sparkling clean, Detective! Ready
    for a brand-new Field Checklist to beat your personal best?
  litterbugConflictDialogue: Looks like you're currently in the middle of the Guardian's
    Litterbug round! Finish or turn in that round first, then come right back to
    me.
